%N A399881 On Artin's conjecture, (A399880(n)/a(n))*C is the relative density of primes with primitive root n among the primes, where C = A005596 is Artin's constant.
%C A399881 a(n) is odd for all n.
%C A399881 a(n) = 1 if and only if n is a square or in A085397; see comments in A399880 for more details.
